<header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HUMAN GOLD RUSH LESSON</p><h1>LAUGH Events</h1><p class="laugh-def"><abbr title="Leaders Annual United Group Hug">LAUGH</abbr> = Leaders Annual United Group Hug — a Detente 2030 human building block / experiment.</p><p class="intro">Find or host local gatherings where trust, gratitude, future plans, and fulfillment opportunities become visible.</p><blockquote>Where can I experience community force in motion?</blockquote><div class="actions"><a href="prepare-laugh-event.html">Host an Event<span>→</span></a><a href="resources.html">Event Toolkit<span>→</span></a></div></header><section class="content-grid"><article><span>01</span><div><h2>Churches</h2><p>Host Practice FAITH conversations, potlucks, learning circles, and locally appropriate fulfillment opportunities.</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h2>Merchants</h2><p>Help fulfill pledged products or services while keeping Seeking Gratitude separate from monetary settlement. Public and private sponsorships are open to any merchant or vendor wishing to donate products or services to a pending Organized Krill kit or LAUGH event.</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><h2>Community centers</h2><p>Provide accessible, neutral gathering places for lessons, events, observation, and reflection.</p></div></article><article><span>04</span><div><h2>Neighbors and messengers</h2><p>Invite respectfully, deliver reliably, and accept participate, observe, or walk-away responses without pressure.</p></div></article><article><span>05</span><div><h2>Redemption Day</h2><p>Every September 1st, LAUGH events culminate in Redemption Day — kite flying, sandcastle building, and a public accounting of the year's presence, starting in 2027. It marks a settlement moment, not a payout.</p></div></article><article><span>06</span><div><h2>Open to any role</h2><p>MEGAvoters and YAM’ers can attend any LAUGH event as a participant, observer, or walk-away — the same three responses, regardless of role.</p></div></article><article><span>07</span><div><h2>RSVP by QR code</h2><p>The RSVP QR code checks for a registered or unregistered device. A registered device heads straight to Discord Gracebook; an unregistered one registers first. An active waitlist is always present — you're scheduled, not received by accident.</p></div></article><article><span>08</span><div><h2>Sponsorships, public or private</h2><p>Merchants and vendors may donate products or services to a pending Organized Krill kit or LAUGH event, listed publicly or kept private, as the sponsor prefers. MEGAvoters package the donation and handle delivery. Standing backorders are settled only through these donations — no surplus inventory is accepted.</p></div></article></section><section><div class="section-heading"><p>EVENT DIRECTORY</p><h2>Upcoming LAUGH events</h2></div><div class="empty-state"><div class="status-dot"></div><h3>Connect the approved event feed</h3><p>Codepixelzmedia can connect this component to the WordPress event content type. Each listing should include host, purpose, accessibility, response choices, consent note, and RSVP.</p></div></section><section class="media-section"><div class="section-heading"><p>MEDIA FOR THIS LESSON</p><h2>Watch, listen, and discuss</h2></div><div class="media-grid"><article class="media-card video"><div class="media-frame"><span>▶</span><small>VIDEO 1</small></div><h3>LAUGH Events: orientation</h3><p>Reserved for the featured story or introductory video.</p><a href="#">Transcript coming soon</a></article><article class="media-card video"><div class="media-frame"><span>▶</span><small>VIDEO 2</small></div><h3>Community conversation</h3><p>Reserved for a demonstration, conversation, or local example.</p><a href="#">Discussion guide coming soon</a></article><article class="media-card podcast"><div class="media-frame"><span>◉</span><small>PODCAST</small></div><h3>Listen and reflect</h3><p>Reserved for the facilitator or community podcast episode.</p><a href="#">Transcript coming soon</a></article></div></section>